  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to the Bangsamoro Agri-Enterprise Programme (BAEP TA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective (Impact) to which this action contributes is: To contribute to a peaceful, cohesive, secure and inclusively developed Bangsamoro By improving the quality, diversity, consistency and responsiveness to the needs of the market of local agricultural production and building an elaborate policy and strategy for further development and investment in Agri-business, the project will contribute to enhance Bangsamoro&#xbf;s own development, open employment opportunities and improve incomes of its people. The latter will contribute to the stability of Bangsamoro and the whole country in general.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
